{"id":"04f467ed4d556c2a","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-thm-euclid-prime.md","title":"Euclid's Proof of Infinitely Many Primes","display":"thm-euclid-prime — Euclid's Proof of Infinitely Many Primes","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-euclid-prime","aliases":["58-thm-euclid-prime"],"display":"thm-euclid-prime — Euclid's Proof of Infinitely Many Primes","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-natural-number.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-euclid-prime"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-euclid-prime</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-euclid-prime — Euclid's Proof of Infinitely Many Primes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3322615e4eea05e9\" href=\"?note=3322615e4eea05e9\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-prime.md\">../batch20/58-df-prime.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0adc4e3c996ff726\" href=\"?note=0adc4e3c996ff726\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-natural-number.md\">../batch08/58-df-natural-number.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为有限素数集（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0adc4e3c996ff726\" href=\"?note=0adc4e3c996ff726\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-natural-number.md\">../batch08/58-df-natural-number.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\">\\(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3322615e4eea05e9\" href=\"?note=3322615e4eea05e9\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-prime.md\">../batch20/58-df-prime.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}euclid\\text{-}prime} \\vdash \\Bigl(F\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land|F|&lt;\\omega\\land\\forall p\\in F\\;\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\Bigr)\\to\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(q)\\land q\\mid(1+\\prod_{p\\in F}p)\\land q\\notin F\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}euclid\\text{-}prime} \\vdash \\Bigl(F\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land|F|&lt;\\omega\\land\\forall p\\in F\\;\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\Bigr)\\to\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(q)\\land q\\mid(1+\\prod_{p\\in F}p)\\land q\\notin F\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_1 \\cdots p_n + 1\">\\(p_1 \\cdots p_n + 1\\)</span> may be composite (e.g., <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 5 \\cdot 7 \\cdot 11 \\cdot 13 + 1 = 30031 = 59 \\cdot 509\">\\(2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 5 \\cdot 7 \\cdot 11 \\cdot 13 + 1 = 30031 = 59 \\cdot 509\\)</span>).</li>\n<li>因为任意有限素数集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 都漏掉上述新素因子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>，素数集不可能有限。</li>\n<li>Sylvester: structure of arithmetic progressions.</li>\n<li>Erdős–Kac: normal distribution of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega(n)\">\\(\\omega(n)\\)</span> (number of prime factors).</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-prime.md","status":"resolved","id":"3322615e4eea05e9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-natural-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"0adc4e3c996ff726","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-natural-number.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-natural-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"0adc4e3c996ff726","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 为有限素数集（see [[../batch08/58-df-natural-number.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-prime.md","status":"resolved","id":"3322615e4eea05e9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)$（see [[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}euclid\\text{-}prime} \\vdash \\Bigl(F\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land|F|<\\omega\\land\\forall p\\in F\\;\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\Bigr)\\to\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(q)\\land q\\mid(1+\\prod_{p\\in F}p)\\land q\\notin F\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"p_1 \\cdots p_n + 1","display":false},{"tex":"2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 5 \\cdot 7 \\cdot 11 \\cdot 13 + 1 = 30031 = 59 \\cdot 509","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega(n)","display":false}],"bytes":1212,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4136","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-thm-euclid-prime.md|58-thm-euclid-prime]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["3322615e4eea05e9","0adc4e3c996ff726"]}